<template name="desk-overlays" content="overlay-extension">
<head></head>
<body>
  <div id="new-session-overlay" class="overlay hidden"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-header"><h2>新建会话</h2><button id="close-new-session">×</button></div><label>会话名称</label><input id="new-session-title" type="text" value="新会话"/><label>所属项目</label><select id="new-session-project" class="select-box"><option data-for="project : view.projects" data-attr-value="project.value">{{project.label}}</option></select><span id="new-session-error" class="form-error"></span><div class="modal-footer"><button id="cancel-new-session" class="secondary-button">取消</button><button id="confirm-new-session" class="primary-button">创建并进入会话</button></div></div></div>
  <div id="composer-popover" class="composer-popover hidden" data-class-hidden="!view.composer_popover_visible">
    <div class="popover-card choice-popover" data-if="view.slash_visible"><strong>命令面板</strong><span class="popover-empty" data-if="!view.slash_has_matches">{{view.slash_empty}}</span><button data-for="command : view.slash_commands" data-class-selected="command.selected" data-attr-command-name="command.command">{{command.command}}<small>{{command.description}}</small></button></div>
    <div class="popover-card title-popover" data-if="view.rename_popover_visible"><strong>重命名会话</strong><input id="rename-title-input" type="text" data-value="view.rename_title"/><button id="confirm-title-rename" class="primary-button">保存</button></div>
    <div class="popover-card choice-popover" data-if="view.choice_popover_visible"><strong>{{view.choice_title}}</strong><button data-for="choice : view.composer_choices" data-attr-choice-kind="choice.kind" data-attr-choice-value="choice.value"><span>{{choice.label}}</span><small data-if="choice.detail != ''">{{choice.detail}}</small></button></div>
  </div>
  <div id="commit-overlay" class="overlay hidden"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-header"><h2>提交更改</h2><button id="close-commit">×</button></div><label>提交信息</label><input id="commit-message" type="text" value="Update from tokmon-desk"/><div class="modal-footer"><button id="cancel-commit" class="secondary-button">取消</button><button id="confirm-commit" class="primary-button">提交</button><button id="confirm-push" class="primary-button">提交并推送</button></div></div></div>
  <div id="discard-overlay" class="overlay hidden"><div class="modal danger-modal"><div class="modal-header"><h2>确认放弃修改</h2><button id="close-discard">×</button></div><p id="discard-description">此操作会修改工作区文件，且无法从 tokmon-desk 撤销。</p><div class="modal-footer"><button id="cancel-discard" class="secondary-button">取消</button><button id="confirm-discard" class="danger-button">确认放弃</button></div></div></div>
  <div id="terminal-paste-overlay" class="overlay hidden"><div class="modal danger-modal"><div class="modal-header"><h2>确认粘贴多行命令</h2></div><p>剪贴板包含换行或终端控制序列，粘贴后可能立即执行命令。仅在确认内容可信时继续。</p><div class="modal-footer"><button id="cancel-terminal-paste" class="secondary-button">取消</button><button id="confirm-terminal-paste" class="danger-button">仍然粘贴</button></div></div></div>
  <div id="file-operation-overlay" class="overlay hidden"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-header"><h2 id="file-operation-title">文件操作</h2><button id="close-file-operation">×</button></div><p id="file-operation-description"></p><label id="file-operation-label">名称</label><input id="file-operation-name" type="text"/><span id="file-operation-error" class="form-error"></span><div class="modal-footer"><button id="cancel-file-operation" class="secondary-button">取消</button><button id="confirm-file-operation" class="primary-button">确认</button></div></div></div>
  <div id="overlay-extension"></div>
</body>
</template>
